title: Minimized and restored several times, a widened panel keeps its width and the canvas its place
folders: git-changes

wait 3000
left files
ui drag 344 400 470 400
wait 600
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1200
mark before
wait 500
minimize
wait 900
restore
wait 900
mark after-1
wait 500
minimize
wait 600
restore
wait 600
minimize
wait 600
restore
wait 900
mark after-3
wait 500
left changes
wait 600
minimize
wait 900
left search
wait 300
restore
wait 900
mark changed-while-minimized
wait 500
resize 1000 640
wait 800
minimize
wait 800
restore
wait 900
mark small-after
wait 500
quit
